    {
      "id": "statement",
      "type": "content.statement-scatter",
      "content": {
        "headline": "Möbius® brings ideas and design together, turning imagination into clarity and connection into beauty.",
        "paragraphs": [
          "At Möbius®, we keep our process clear, collaborative, and focused. We work closely as a small team, shaping each project with intention and care. Every idea is explored from multiple angles, refined together, and guided by a shared sense of purpose. Nothing is added without reason, and nothing essential is left behind. The result is work that feels thoughtful, precise, and built to last beyond trends.",
          "Our way of working is straightforward. We stay small by choice, keeping the process open and honest so decisions remain meaningful. Dialogue is constant, feedback is collective, and the direction becomes sharper with every step. We believe clarity comes from collaboration, and that strong ideas emerge when the team thinks as one."
        ]
      },
      "motion": {
